Z||000024||TwisT||01-04-2000||10:59 PM||||...If I knew how to post a picture, I'd do it...  but I sent you one through email anyway.  I have a few more of the Tantrum on different cars,  if you are interested...||||reg||1
Z||000025||Monkeyman||01-05-2000||05:18 AM||||I got the email.  Thanx and send more.  There was another wheel (also a Konig?) on a blue GT posted here.  Anybody know what that was and send me a pic.  <P>TwisT-Here's how to post a pic on the Forum.  Click on the icon at the bottom of the page (Pennocks Image Poster).  Download it and follow the instructions.  Basically all you have to do (once you have it) is to open it, click on Browse, pick your pic, click on Post It, and once the image has uploaded, press Ctrl-V to insert it in your post.  Piece of cake!||||reg||1
